{
	"name": "Flammable",
	"type": "feat",
	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Activate this feature if the [[lookup @name lowercase]] takes at least 5 Fire damage.</strong></p><p>If the [[lookup @name lowercase]] takes at least 5 Fire damage at once, it catches fire. It burns until a creature other than itself that isn't also flammable takes an action to put the fire out.</p><p>Once ignited, the [[lookup @name lowercase]] takes [[/damage 1d10 fire]] damage at the end of each of its turns, which is dealt regardless of the target's damage threshold.</p>",
